Projects/
assets/
Fonts/
CV/
*.mp4.part

# design references, screenshots and working notes
Website Reference/
screenshots/
Links/
PROJECT_BRIEF.md

# local tool settings
.claude/
.vercel/

# OS / editor clutter
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.log
__pycache__/
